  m_text: '<b><color=#ff0>Recording Instructions</color></b>

    Spout makes recording
    with OBS less taxing on your PC

    1) Install Spout2 for OBS <size=18><color=#08f><u>https://github.com/Off-World-Live/obs-spout2-plugin</u></color></size>

    2)
    Enable Spout Stream in the VRChat Camera

    3) Override the VRC camera in the
    OBS tab'
