      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><color=green>Camera System Explanation</color></b>

    It is important
    that we are always hitting 60fps or above. VRChat has a built-in camera and a
    drone camera for VRC+ users. These tools will give you the best FPS, especially
    if used with Spout.


    There are 8 world cameras that you can spawn from the
    <b>Cameras</b>. Pick a camera from the dropdown and select <color=red>Take Ownership</color>.
    As the owner, you will be able to control its <b><color=yellow>Mode, Target,
    and Zoom</color></b>


    <b><color=#f80>NOTE:

    You must enable the OBS
    tab to capture output from the cameras to OBS.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
